verified_revision_source = "The final hf-done JSON and private /out/run/gates.jsonl name the exact verified content-derived candidate revision, command, exit code and log path. Build and verify must pass on the same candidate revision. The record is finalized before qualification; embedding its own candidate hash would change the candidate. Only a passing hf-done establishes closure. The runner retains the evidence and commits the result; no manual commit or push."
